      "overview": "## Development Environment Setup\n\nThis lesson walks you through setting up a professional development environment for fullstack web development.\n\n### Topics covered\n- Installing Node.js and npm\n- Setting up VS Code with essential extensions\n- Understanding project folder structure\n- Running your first development server\n\n### Why this matters\nA correctly configured environment helps you avoid common setup issues, improve productivity, and follow industry best practices from day one.\n\nMake sure you complete this step before moving on to advanced topics.",
