      "title": "React Hook",
      "description": "## Assignment Overview\n\nIn this assignment, you will build a React application that demonstrates effective usage of React Hooks.\n\n### Objectives\n- Use `useState` to manage component state\n- Use `useEffect` to handle side effects such as API calls\n- Create at least one custom hook for reusable logic\n\n### Guidelines\n- Follow React Hooks rules\n- Write clean and readable code\n- Ensure proper component structure\n\nThis assignment helps reinforce core React concepts used in modern applications.",
