      "id": "0925",
      "course_id": 34,
      "title": "Build a React CRUD Application",
      "description": "## Assignment Overview\n\nIn this assignment, you will build a complete CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) application using React.\n\n### Objectives\n\n- Manage state using `useState` \n-  Fetch data using `useEffect`\n- Implement form handling\n- Handle list rendering with unique keys\n- Use controlled components\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. Create a form to add new items\n2. Display items in a list\n3. Allow editing existing items\n4. Allow deleting items\n5.  Maintain clean component structure\n\n### Submission Guidelines\n\n- Submit working source code\n- Follow clean coding practices\n- Use meaningful variable names\n- Handle edge cases properly\n\nThis assignment will help you understand real-world React application structure.",
